{"pageid":2733,"title":"Brick","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Brick</span>","revid":20404,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Brick</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/17/Brick-removebg-preview.png/revision/latest?cb=20240423013054\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Brick-removebg-preview\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/17/Brick-removebg-preview.png/revision/latest?cb=20240423013054\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/17/Brick-removebg-preview.png/revision/latest?cb=20240423013054 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/17/Brick-removebg-preview.png/revision/latest?cb=20240423013054 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Brick-removebg-preview\" width=\"200\" height=\"148\" data-image-key=\"Brick-removebg-preview.png\" data-image-name=\"Brick-removebg-preview.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flora_Laura\" title=\"Flora Laura\">Flora Laura</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$15</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Decoration and building</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.54.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">April 14th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><big>\"Why.. why would you want a singular brick?\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Brick</b> is a special item bought in <a href=\"/wiki/Flora_Laura\" title=\"Flora Laura\">Flora Laura</a> for $15. It is located in the wall in the right side room near the stairs.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The brick can be used as a building material, one brick can fill up to 60 cubic studs, E.g. a 1x6x10 cube (See fig. 1 for example).</li>\n<li>The brick can be painted as of v1.63.0.</li>\n<li>The brick can be dyed using a <a href=\"/wiki/Dye_Machine\" title=\"Dye Machine\">Dye Machine</a>.</li>\n<li>A similar brick can be seen in the lighthouse in white, but cannot be bought.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Building_Tips\">Building Tips</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Bricks used in a cube schematic interlock with each other. (fig. 1)</li>\n<li>Bricks used in the Rotated Bricks schematic are a bit off, as they are not large enough to entirely fill each of the schematic's bricks. (fig. 2)</li>\n<li>Bricks used in the Small Rotated Bricks schematic perfectly fit each of the schematic's bricks. (fig. 2)</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dd/Brick_Wall.png/revision/latest?cb=20251108162957\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Fig\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dd/Brick_Wall.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251108162957\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"112\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Brick Wall.png\" data-image-key=\"Brick_Wall.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Brick_Wall.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">[Fig. 1] A 1x6x10 cube filled with brick.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 328px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/26/Brick_Walls.png/revision/latest?cb=20251108161644\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Fig\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/26/Brick_Walls.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/328?cb=20251108161644\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"328\" height=\"99\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Brick Walls.png\" data-image-key=\"Brick_Walls.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Brick_Walls.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">[Fig. 2] Brick being the material in the Small Rotated Brick schematic (Left) and the Rotated Brick schematic (Right).</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902140200\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 60/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 58/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019393/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.339      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   30.339      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2733-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902140200 and revision id 20404. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Description"],"links":[{"title":"Finlay Island","exists":true},{"title":"Flora Laura","exists":true},{"title":"Dye Machine","exists":true}],"images":["Brick-removebg-preview.png","Brick_Wall.png","Brick_Walls.png"]}
